error: `readLineAsync` lends the reader, and a call without `await` starts it as a task of its own, which a borrow cannot go to
  --> error_async_reader_unawaited.sg:3:16
 3 |     var task = Stdin.readLineAsync(ref line)
   |                ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  hint: `await Stdin.readLineAsync(ref line)` runs it as part of this task, where it can borrow
